{"id":"624918","name":"发面饼","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/624918/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"5克"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉和酵母粉混合。","img":"images/624918/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入鸡蛋、盐和十三香粉。","img":"images/624918/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入温水，和成絮状。","img":"images/624918/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成面团，静置发酵。","img":"images/624918/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"发酵后移至面板，揉匀排气。","img":"images/624918/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"分成小份。","img":"images/624918/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"每一份揉圆，压扁。","img":"images/624918/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用叉子扎小孔。","img":"images/624918/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煎烤机预热刷油，放入饼胚。","img":"images/624918/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"上下盘同时加热。","img":"images/624918/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"两面金黄色出锅。","img":"images/624918/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"可做三餐主食。","img":"images/624918/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"每500克面粉添加5克酵母粉。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}